sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant API as apps/api (RunsController)
  participant Redis

  Client->>API: GET /api/v1/runs (listRuns)
  Note right of API: apps/api/src/api/runs.controller.ts:589-711 listRuns
  API->>API: Parse query (page, limit, sortBy, sortOrder, status)
  API->>Redis: SMEMBERS tenant:tenantId:runs
  alt No run IDs
    API-->>Client: 200 []
  else Has run IDs
    loop for each runId
      API->>Redis: GET run:runId
      alt Missing runData
        API->>API: skip
      else Has runData
        API->>API: Filter by userId
        API->>API: Filter by status (optional)
      end
    end
    API->>API: Sort by sortKey (default createdAt)
    API->>API: Paginate (page, limit)
    API->>API: metrics.requestCounter success
    API-->>Client: 200 [runs]
  end
  opt Internal Failure
    API-->>Client: 500 { error: INTERNAL_ERROR }
  end
